WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.235 --> 00:00:02.581
- They're kind of like
dinosaurs, but not in a good way.

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:04.938
Just in a terrifying way,

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:06.878
like they could revert at any time.

00:00:06.878 --> 00:00:10.721
(mysterious music and birds cawing)

00:00:10.721 --> 00:00:13.967
- I don't like birds,
whether they're small or big,

00:00:13.967 --> 00:00:14.953
or whatever they're doing,

00:00:14.953 --> 00:00:16.455
if they're just sitting there or flying,

00:00:16.455 --> 00:00:19.315
I do not like them at all.

00:00:19.315 --> 00:00:22.153
- I have immediate fear of them.

00:00:22.153 --> 00:00:24.714
- They're messy, they shit on everything.

00:00:24.714 --> 00:00:26.233
- The weird feet.

00:00:26.233 --> 00:00:27.452
- I'm kind of scared that they're gonna

00:00:27.452 --> 00:00:29.733
just attack every single human being.

00:00:29.733 --> 00:00:32.632
- [Voiceover] There is a
surprise element to this video.

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:34.472
(ding)

00:00:34.472 --> 00:00:36.047
- Please don't bring in a bird.

00:00:38.862 --> 00:00:40.878
(groans) What's that noise?

00:00:40.878 --> 00:00:42.086
- Is it in front of my face?

00:00:42.086 --> 00:00:43.142
- [Voiceover] Not yet.

00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:44.654
- What, not yet?

00:00:44.654 --> 00:00:45.892
[Voiceover] Open your eyes.

00:00:53.102 --> 00:00:55.311
- [Blonde Woman] You can do it. (laughs)

00:00:55.311 --> 00:00:56.613
- (gasps) Oh!
- [Man] Oh my God.

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:02.480
- (gasps) Oh my God!

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:03.160
- Oh my God.

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:04.128
- Oh my God!

00:01:04.128 --> 00:01:05.539
(gasps quietly)

00:01:06.584 --> 00:01:08.529
- Oh my God, there are three of them!

00:01:08.529 --> 00:01:09.371
- It's ducks.

00:01:11.024 --> 00:01:11.897
It's ducks.

00:01:11.897 --> 00:01:14.271
- Oh my God, they're so yellow!

00:01:14.271 --> 00:01:15.732
- Hi.

00:01:15.732 --> 00:01:18.308
- Hi, hey.

00:01:18.308 --> 00:01:19.272
- Hi.

00:01:20.902 --> 00:01:23.625
(woman laughs)

00:01:23.625 --> 00:01:24.960
- It's a baby.

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:25.893
- No! No!

00:01:25.893 --> 00:01:28.372
Don't! Don't!

00:01:28.372 --> 00:01:29.893
- I think mine's shitting on my hand.

00:01:29.893 --> 00:01:31.120
My hand feels moist.

00:01:32.134 --> 00:01:32.893
- Ah!

00:01:32.893 --> 00:01:34.475
- Oh my God, holy shit!

00:01:36.426 --> 00:01:37.836
They're so cute!

00:01:37.836 --> 00:01:40.216
- I'm so not scared of these ones.

00:01:40.216 --> 00:01:41.824
- I'm your mother now.

00:01:41.824 --> 00:01:43.598
- Oh my God, look at the little wings.

00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:47.000
Oh, the bugs.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:48.287
- [Pink Haired Woman] Is it soft?

00:01:48.287 --> 00:01:50.050
- As long as I look at it this way,

00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:52.989
and I can't see his eyes
or his beak or his claws,

00:01:52.989 --> 00:01:54.444
he's super cute!

00:01:54.444 --> 00:01:56.251
- It's kind of awkward though.

00:01:56.251 --> 00:01:58.224
'Cause I feel I've eaten a lot of these,

00:01:58.224 --> 00:01:59.183
and it's really bad.

00:01:59.183 --> 00:02:00.210
I'm like, "Sorry!"

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:02.091
It's true, people eat ducks!

00:02:02.091 --> 00:02:03.786
- [Woman] But you don't have to eat ducks!

00:02:03.786 --> 00:02:05.050
- Dude, I'm really sorry!

00:02:05.050 --> 00:02:07.545
I never thought I would
see you eye to eye.

00:02:09.575 --> 00:02:10.253
- Oh!

00:02:10.253 --> 00:02:10.988
- That noise!

00:02:10.988 --> 00:02:12.644
- He's making a little wiffle noise.

00:02:12.644 --> 00:02:15.796
- I can look at it and I
can appreciate its cuteness,

00:02:16.759 --> 00:02:18.258
but I can't carry it.

00:02:18.258 --> 00:02:20.171
No. (laughs)

00:02:20.171 --> 00:02:22.219
- I feel like a good duck mother.

00:02:22.219 --> 00:02:23.836
- I feel like a horrible duck father.

00:02:23.836 --> 00:02:25.194
- [Blonde Woman] This
doesn't count as a bird.

00:02:25.194 --> 00:02:26.939
It's not flapping in my face.

00:02:26.939 --> 00:02:28.615
It's not pooing on my car.

00:02:28.615 --> 00:02:31.572
- This is the best surprise
that I think I've ever had.

00:02:31.572 --> 00:02:33.933
- His eyes are still
really freaking me out

00:02:33.933 --> 00:02:35.256
when I look at them.

00:02:35.256 --> 00:02:36.578
- Yeah, I like birds.

00:02:36.578 --> 00:02:37.314
They're cool.

00:02:37.314 --> 00:02:41.599
- See, these are what raptors became.

00:02:41.599 --> 00:02:42.301
If they were bigger -

00:02:42.301 --> 00:02:43.404
- [Blonde Woman] Oh my God, chill buddy.

00:02:43.404 --> 00:02:44.484
- They would eat me.

00:02:44.484 --> 00:02:47.631
This does not change how
I feel about birds at all.

00:02:47.631 --> 00:02:50.470
- I am still a bit freaked out.

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:54.499
- I definitely like birds
a lot more after today.

00:02:54.499 --> 00:02:55.892
- After looking at a duck in the eyes,

00:02:55.892 --> 00:02:58.549
I'm gonna try not to eat duck now.

00:02:58.549 --> 00:03:00.292
- Hate birds.

00:03:00.292 --> 00:03:02.206
Like fluffy things.

00:03:02.206 --> 00:03:06.254
- (sings Lion King opening song)

00:03:06.254 --> 00:03:08.075
♫ I love ducks. ♫

00:03:08.075 --> 00:03:10.596
I just wanna be a duck queen,

00:03:10.596 --> 00:03:12.769
and just be surrounded by ducks

00:03:12.769 --> 00:03:14.490
for the rest of my life, to be honest.

